{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S06弱化了对方不知道他曾经多害怕、因此产生孤独感的心理落差；S13也省略了他想把喜欢藏回去以减少受伤的反复，人物心理转折不如Y完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用重点词放大建立了清楚的视觉入口，感受文字又能随音乐分段出现，观众不必在一堆同时出现的短词里寻找对应关系，扫屏和抓重点更容易。它的音乐细节、身体感受和情绪变化也更细腻具体，尤其能让人感到情绪如何随音乐起伏。不过Y的叙事解释更完整，人物为什么犹豫、害怕、孤独，以及前后心理如何转变，交代得更充分；X在压缩过程中牺牲了一部分这种连续性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e4f6df38-0758-4bca-aa91-aa3800340837", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T080520471902Z", "elapsed_seconds": 123.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T08:07:24.191477+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d8820ed8261d3354a24d8ea5b2c4557157be3129b3b7229e6e28cc4005c1012e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web